{"schemaVersion":1,"title":"Tire Guide","flows":[{"id":"44ywg","position":{"x":-1489.9698665564656,"y":2584.84593659053},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p><div target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://google.com\">https://google.com</div> </p>"},{"id":"47cnH","position":{"x":703.1697536184959,"y":3621.5653588695736},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>Based on your needs, this is the tire we recommend.{recommendationBlurb}</h4>"},{"id":"4WWmU","position":{"x":-1672.1246774586052,"y":2185.637843783826},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p></p><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><case data-id=\"c-mggNN\" class=\"\">map(recommendedTires)</case></switch>"},{"id":"4mP4e","position":{"x":671.6966862441241,"y":-2794.253301540776},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>Is it one of these?</h4><p>If not, I'm afraid we can't advise.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">otherVehicle</assignee><case data-id=\"c-PkqYE\" class=\"\">Corolla '09–18</case><case data-id=\"c-QitGM\" class=\"\">Corolla '19–22</case><case data-id=\"c-3cTka\" class=\"\">Yaris '07–14</case><case data-id=\"c-T98jP\" class=\"\">Scion XD '08–14</case><case data-id=\"c-Pjq4w\" class=\"\">Scion IQ '12–15</case><case data-id=\"c-GaQY6\" class=\"\">Lexus CT200h</case></switch>"},{"id":"CHLKc","position":{"x":-1176.778675246877,"y":2120.6424520618743},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<ul class=\"not-prose\" data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p> dddd</p><ul class=\"not-prose\" data-type=\"taskList\"><li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p>dddd</p></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>dddd</p></div></li></ul></div></li><li data-checked=\"false\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\"><span></span></label><div><p>dddfa</p></div></li></ul><p></p><p>ddd</p>"},{"id":"EDF6K","position":{"x":-48.98159328650331,"y":3648.2720350105037},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>Based on your needs, we recommend choosing from these {tireCount} tires.{recommendationBlurb}</h4>"},{"id":"HptdD","position":{"x":-432.8197837422533,"y":56.883844479697814},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p><strong>Maximizing fuel economy comes at the expense of ground clearance and performance in adverse conditions like dirt, mud, rain, or snow. These tires are best for commuters!</strong></p>"},{"id":"LTqDE","position":{"x":2029.819495005524,"y":3460.62806065331},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><case data-id=\"c-ULKnx\" class=\"\"></case></switch>"},{"id":"MGcAW","position":{"x":3213.7768766354748,"y":-1468.6799740588324},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p>Thanks! I will try to get back to you within 2 business days.</p>"},{"id":"NP4rd","position":{"x":609.6320579533468,"y":-1086.788055158806},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p>Most Priuses come with 15\" rims, but Toyota also offers a larger and more expensive set of 17\" rims. It is very unlikely that you have 16\" rims, unless you or a previous owner purchased a completely new set of aftermarket wheels.</p><p>If for some reason you are unable to identify the size from your tires, use a measuring tape to measure the diameter of your hubcaps.</p><p>Change your answer above once you have identified your rim size.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"c-8zCWc\" class=\"\">Still Unsure</case><case data-id=\"c-fMHg3\" class=\"\">It's Something Else</case></switch>"},{"id":"Q7rYQ","position":{"x":2990.6217837621994,"y":1949.6880011158364},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h2>AltiMAX RT43</h2><h3>Size: 205/70 R15</h3><p>This tire rules</p><p><img src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/9c59002cdad656222e0031342fd68461484575de40f9d537085d3af600d72fec\"></p>"},{"id":"RRq7H","position":{"x":606.8626935592388,"y":57.98955014904054},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p><strong>Maximizing ruggedness can come at the expense of fuel economy, noise, and tire life. These tires are best for adventurers!</strong></p>"},{"id":"UMpCn","position":{"x":199.58538028746534,"y":355.38670787345256},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<pre><code>const maxFuel = maximize == \"Maximum Fuel Economy\"\n\nconst maxRugged = maximize == \"Maximum Ruggedness\"\n\nconst maxDiameter = vehicle.Maximum_Trimmed_Tire_Diameter - (chains == 'Yes' ? 1:0)\n\n// Make this actually connect to button\nconst snowLevels = ['Never', 'Occasionally', 'Frequently', 'Winter']\n\nlet recommendedTires = tires.filter(tire =&gt; {\n  if (snowLevels.indexOf(snow) &gt;  snowLevels.indexOf(tire.Snow_Level))\n    return false\n\n  if (tire.Snow_Level == 'Winter' &amp;&amp; snow != 'Frequently')\n    return false\n  \n  switch (maximize) {\n    case ('Maximum Ruggedness'):\n      return tire.Ruggedness == 3 || tire.Ruggedness == 4\n      break\n    case ('Maximum Fuel Economy'):\n      return tire.Ruggedness == 1 || tire.Ruggedness == 2\n      break\n    default:\n      return tire.Ruggedness == 2 || tire.Ruggedness == 3\n      break\n  }\n\n  return true\n}).map(v =&gt; Object.assign({}, v))\n\nconst formula = `AND({Diameter}&gt;=${vehicle.Standard_Diameter},{Diameter}&lt;=${maxDiameter},{Rim}=${rimSize.replaceAll('\"','')})`\n\nconst sizes = (await (await fetch(`https://api.airtable.com/v0/appnqPFee60PlXjcg/Sizes?filterByFormula=${formula}`, \n    {\n      method: 'GET',\n      headers: {\n        Accept: 'application/json',\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n        Authorization: `Bearer keyQviYovwIMo11IU`,\n      },\n    }\n  )).json()).records\n  console.log('SIZES!', sizes)\n\nfor (let tire of recommendedTires) {\n  tire.Sizes = tire.Sizes.filter(v =&gt; sizes.find(b =&gt; b.id == v))\n  tire.Sizes = tire.Sizes.map(v =&gt; sizes.find(b =&gt; b.id == v).fields)\n}\n\nrecommendedTires = recommendedTires.filter(v =&gt; v.Sizes.length &gt; 0)\n\nfunction trunc(n, p=1) {\n  return  Math.round(\n    n*Math.pow(10, p)\n  ) / Math.pow(10, p)\n}\n\nconst recommendationBlurb = `${maxFuel?` Since fuel economy is your priority, we've chosen a size closer to your vehicle's standard tires.` : maxRugged?` Since ruggedness is your priority, we've chosen a large size to maximize your ground clearance.`:` We've chosen an intermediate size to balance fuel economy and ground clearance.`}`\n\nconst tireCount = recommendedTires.length\nlet tire\nlet tireSize\nlet tireSizes\nlet allowedSizes\nlet recommendedSize\nlet blurb\nlet raisedHeight\nlet baseHeight = trunc(vehicle.Base_Height)\nlet truncDiameter\nlet requiresTrimming\nlet winter\nlet tagString = ''\nlet tags = ''\nlet ruggednessBlurb = ''\nlet testUrl = 'https://polytrope.com'</code></pre><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"c-3YPxX\" class=\"\">recommendedTires.length == 0</case><case data-id=\"c-bpgjB\" class=\"\">recommendedTires.length == 1</case></switch>"},{"id":"Ugprj","position":{"x":-4623.867991466785,"y":80},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<div row=\"true\" class=\"group basis-64 grow flex row flex-wrap\"><h5>Generation I (2001–03)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/2c9825caec368b0b54d20d4d1efcc18e7ea620bf1512690ec2acaf9ed2a232fc\"></h5></div>"},{"id":"UkkxE","position":{"x":757.8613138081387,"y":-392.27316886185787},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<p>Sorry to hear you're still having trouble. Please send me an email at priusoffroad+rims@gmail.com with a few close-up photos of your wheels so I can help you out!</p>"},{"id":"X4Etc","position":{"x":221.73071727663614,"y":-2020.137464248878},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<pre><code>const vehicles = (await (await fetch(`https://api.airtable.com/v0/appnqPFee60PlXjcg/Vehicles`, \n  {\n    method: 'GET',\n    headers: {\n      Accept: 'application/json',\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n      Authorization: `Bearer keyQviYovwIMo11IU`,\n    },\n  }\n)).json()).records.map(v =&gt; v.fields)\nconsole.log('VEHICLES!', vehicles)\n\nlet vehicle\nif (priusGeneration != 'Something Else') {\n  vehicle = vehicles.find(v =&gt; v.Key.startsWith(priusGeneration))\n}\nelse {\n  vehicle = vehicles.find(v =&gt; v.Key == otherVehicle)\n}\nconsole.log('VEHICLE!', vehicle)</code></pre><h4>What size are your rims?</h4><p>Look for the size printed on the side of your tire, something like 195/60R15. The number after the R on your tire is the diameter of your rims in inches.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">rimSize</assignee><case data-id=\"c-bd7mD\" class=\"\">15\"</case><case data-id=\"c-EMe6W\" class=\"\">16\"</case><case data-id=\"c-B6EHD\" class=\"\">17\"</case><case data-id=\"c-Hwx6y\" class=\"\">I don't know</case></switch>"},{"id":"akbff","position":{"x":1665.869414430733,"y":2896.9560848888814},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<pre><code>tireSize = tireSizes.pop()</code></pre><p>{tireSize.Key}</p><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><case data-id=\"c-y9Cyy\" class=\"\">tireSizes.length &gt; 0</case></switch>"},{"id":"djBGe","position":{"x":2203.7339837159416,"y":1835.2651054332882},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h2>Michelin CrossClimate 2</h2><h3>Size: 205/70 R15</h3><p><img src=\"https://static.tirerack.com/content/dam/tires/michelin/mi_crossclimate_2_full.jpg?imwidth=440&amp;impolicy=tow-pdp-main\"></p>"},{"id":"fzdXq","position":{"x":-137.46661932535145,"y":-1117.0089993552401},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>Do you expect to use these tires in snow?</h4><p>This is a major factor in choosing a tire. If you're driving in winter conditions, we'll make sure to only recommend tires that are up to the job.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">snow</assignee><case data-id=\"c-B9Xkg\" class=\"\">Frequently</case><case data-id=\"c-86x4p\" class=\"\">Occasionally</case><case data-id=\"c-3KnNc\" class=\"\">Never</case></switch><pre><code>const neverSnowBlurb = snow == 'Never' ? ' Since you never expect to drive in snow, this may not be relevant to you.' : ''</code></pre><h4>Do you want to ensure that tire chains or cables will fit?</h4><p>Traction devices like tire chains or cables require a little extra space in the wheel well to install, so we factor that into our size recommendation.{neverSnowBlurb}</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">chains</assignee><case data-id=\"c-A6wdB\" class=\"\">Yes</case><case data-id=\"c-AQQNz\" class=\"\">No</case></switch><h4>Are you trying to <em>absolute</em>ly <em>maximize </em>either fuel economy or ruggedness?</h4><p>Put simply, there is a fundamental tradeoff between these considerations. Offroad tires tend to be noisier and might cost you a few MPG. [Low-rolling-resistance](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Low_rolling_resistance_tire) tires are great on the highway, but struggle in rough conditions. Bigger tires provide ground clearance, smaller tires preserve mileage. We usually recommend something in-between.</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">maximize</assignee><case data-id=\"c-NT4UK\" class=\"\">Maximum Fuel Economy</case><case data-id=\"c-zQgf3\" class=\"\">Maximum Ruggedness</case><case data-id=\"c-JjeYx\" class=\"\">No Strict Preference</case></switch>"},{"id":"jnFGm","position":{"x":-592.708116892478,"y":-7922.1567739981165},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<pre><code class=\"language-css\">@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Montserrat';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/montserrat/v25/JTUHjIg1_i6t8kCHKm4532VJOt5-QNFgpCtr6Hw5aXp-p7K4KLg.woff2) format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Montserrat';\n  font-style: bold;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/montserrat/v25/JTUSjIg1_i6t8kCHKm459WlhyyTh89Y.woff2) format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Archivo Black';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/archivoblack/v17/HTxqL289NzCGg4MzN6KJ7eW6CYyF_jzx13E.woff2) format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2000-206F, U+2074, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n\n\n#guide {\n  background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22);\n  font-family: 'Montserrat', arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\nh1,h2,h3 {\n  font-family: 'Archivo Black', arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n  font-size: 33px !important;\n}\n\nh2 {\n  color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n  font-size: 29px !important;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 24px !important;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  font-size: 22px !important;\n  color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\n}\n\nh5 {\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  font-size: 18px !important;\n  color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\n}\n\np {\n  font-size: 16px !important;\n  color: rgb(164, 164, 164);\n}\n\n.node-case &gt; div {\n  font-size: 22px !important;\n  font-weight: 400 !important;\n  color: #FFF;\n  border-color: #FFF;\n  background-color: rgb(22, 22, 22);\n}\n\n.node-case &gt; .selected {\n  background-color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n}\n\n.node-case &gt; *:not(.selected):hover {\n  background-color: rgb(255, 123, 0);\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 250px;\n  border-radius: 1rem;\n  margin: 0 !important;\n}\n\n#generations {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n#generations img {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\n}</code></pre><h1>WHICH TIRES DO I NEED?</h1><p>This is the most common question I get. There is no simple answer, and no perfect tire; every option comes with tradeoffs. We built this guide to help you narrow down from thousands of models and sizes to a few solid choices, guaranteed to fit your vehicle, tested and recommended by Prius Offroaders worldwide.</p><p>Our recommendations should be a starting point for your research. Read the product pages, peruse the reviews; <strong>you are responsible for the tires you choose.</strong> If you are all good with that,</p><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"L3LTfw4\" class=\"\">Let's get started!</case></switch>"},{"id":"mtjTN","position":{"x":44.340622425771016,"y":7372.859988226627},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>These tires are just a recommendation, but each of them are guaranteed to work with our lift kits.<br><br>Beware that large tires may rub against the plastic in your wheel well and require some trimming to fit!</h4><p><br><em>If you see a problem with this guide or have any other feedback, I would like to know! Send me an email at priusoffroad+tireguide@gmail.com</em></p>"},{"id":"nCCUM","position":{"x":-4.97924891761329,"y":4200.399185238205},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<pre><code>function trunc(n, p=1) {\n  return  Math.round(\n    n*Math.pow(10, p)\n  ) / Math.pow(10, p)\n}\n\nfunction clearance(size) {\n  return vehicle.Base_Ground_Clearance+(size.Diameter-vehicle.Standard_Diameter)/2+1.5\n}\n\ntire = recommendedTires.pop()\n\ntire.Sizes.sort((a, b) =&gt; a.Diameter-b.Diameter)\n\ntire.Sizes = tire.Sizes.filter(v =&gt; v.Diameter &gt;= vehicle.Standard_Diameter)\n\nwinter = tire.Snow_Level === 'Winter'\nconsole.log('SNOW!', snow, tire.Snow_Level, winter, tire.Snow_Level === 'Winter')\n\n// Picks the largest tire\nif (maxRugged)\n  recommendedSize = tire.Sizes.reduce((a, b) =&gt; (b.Diameter &gt; a.Diameter &amp;&amp; b.Diameter &lt; vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter) ? b : a)\n// Picks the tire closest to the standard size for this vehicle\nelse if (maxFuel)\n  recommendedSize = tire.Sizes.reduce((a, b) =&gt;\n  Math.abs(a.Diameter-vehicle.Standard_Diameter) &lt;\n  Math.abs(b.Diameter-vehicle.Standard_Diameter) ?\n  a : b)\n// Picks a tire halfway between the standard and maximum tire sizes\nelse\n  recommendedSize = tire.Sizes.reduce((a, b) =&gt;\n  Math.abs(a.Diameter-(vehicle.Standard_Diameter+vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter)/2) &lt;\n  Math.abs(b.Diameter-(vehicle.Standard_Diameter+vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter)/2) ?\n  a : b)\n  \n\ntruncDiameter = trunc(recommendedSize.Diameter)\nfinalHeight = trunc(clearance(recommendedSize))\nrequiresTrimming = recommendedSize.Diameter &gt; vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter\n\n// Constructs a list of all possible tire sizes\ntireSizes = '&lt;b&gt;All Fitting Sizes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;'+tire.Sizes.map(v =&gt; `${recommendedSize == v ? '&lt;b&gt;':''}&lt;a href=${v.Tire_Rack_URL}&gt;${v.Key}&lt;/a&gt; — ${trunc(v.Diameter)}\" diameter, ${trunc(clearance(v))}\" clearance${v.Diameter &lt; vehicle.Maximum_Tire_Diameter ? '':' — &lt;i&gt;May Require Trimming! &lt;/i&gt;'}${recommendedSize == v ? '&lt;/b&gt;':''}`).join('&lt;br&gt;')\n\n//tagString = ' '+tire.Tags.map(v =&gt; v.slice(0, 3)).join('')\ntagString = winter ? '  ❄️':''\ntags = tire.Tags.map(v =&gt; '  '+v).join('&lt;br&gt;')\n\nswitch (tire.Ruggedness) {\n  case 1:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This tire offers the absolute maximum MPG, but at the expense of durability and tread life.'\n    break\n  case 2:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This all-around tire offers balanced performance across a range of highway conditions.'\n    break\n  case 3:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This tire is more rugged than your standard touring tire, without giving up its highway manners.'\n    break\n  case 4:\n    ruggednessBlurb = ' This extra-rugged tire excels off-road, but at the expense of noise and fuel economy.'\n    break\n}\n\n// Constructs a blurb about why this tire\nblurb = `Combined with our lift kit, this tire brings your vehicle from ${vehicle.Base_Ground_Clearance}\" up to &lt;b&gt;${finalHeight}\" of ground clearance!&lt;/b&gt;${ruggednessBlurb}${winter?' Please note that &lt;b&gt;this is a winter tire,&lt;/b&gt; it should only be used in &lt;b&gt;temperatures below 45°&lt;/b&gt;.':''}${requiresTrimming ? ' However, even the smallest size of this tire &lt;b&gt;may rub against your vehicle&lt;/b&gt; unless you trim some plastic from the inside of your wheel well.':''}`</code></pre><div row=\"true\" id=\"\" class=\"group basis-64 grow flex row flex-wrap\"><div row=\"false\" id=\"\" class=\"group basis-64 grow column\"><h2>{tire.Key}{tagString}</h2><h4>[Recommended Size: {recommendedSize.Key}]({recommendedSize.Tire_Rack_URL})</h4><h5><strong>Ruggedness: {tire.Ruggedness}/4</strong></h5><h5>{tags}</h5><p>{blurb}</p><p><strong>From the manufacturer:</strong><br>\"{tire.Description}\"</p><p>{tireSizes}</p></div><p><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"{tire.Image}\" alt=\"\"></p></div><switch data-switchtype=\"condition\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><case data-id=\"c-RM7qQ\" class=\"\">recommendedTires.length &gt; 0</case></switch>"},{"id":"nhHxp","position":{"x":1441.1506580680325,"y":1696.4456984763215},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h2>GEOLANDAR A/T G015</h2><h3>Size: 205/70 R15</h3><p>This tire rules</p><p><img src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/4736124463e8eb6d53f680adbe2af6d2c46db0367df5f9f15b4037be4d0a7273\"></p>"},{"id":"prUKA","position":{"x":-783.0348675138471,"y":3587.463828813938},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>We do not currently have any tires that match your needs in our database :(</h4>"},{"id":"prptw","position":{"x":-3222.309151749868,"y":-947.2693628275913},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<h4>Which vehicle do you need tires for?</h4><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex\"><assignee class=\"\">vehicleCategory</assignee><case data-id=\"c-btWwA\" class=\"\">Prius</case><case data-id=\"c-BGjGy\" class=\"\">Corolla</case><case data-id=\"c-Yd8PN\" class=\"\">Lexus CT200h</case></switch>"},{"id":"qiKTB","position":{"x":-416.0062921755143,"y":-4333.984241231774},"type":"branch","flowtext":"<pre><code>const tires = (await (await fetch(`https://api.airtable.com/v0/appnqPFee60PlXjcg/Tires`, \n  {\n    method: 'GET',\n    headers: {\n      Accept: 'application/json',\n      'Content-Type': 'application/json',\n      Authorization: `Bearer keyQviYovwIMo11IU`,\n    },\n  }\n)).json()).records.map(v =&gt; v.fields)\n\nfor (const tire of tires) {\n  if (tire.Image)\n    tire.Image = tire.Image[0].url\n}\n\nconsole.log('TIRES!', tires)</code></pre><h4>Which generation is your Prius?</h4><p>If you don't know this off the top of your head, try comparing the dashboard and exterior to the images below.</p><div row=\"true\" id=\"generations\" class=\"group basis-64 grow flex row flex-wrap\"><h5>Generation II ('04–09)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/d0defdabb39bd0032d01c0ac39d72a2db68618135dd8a3b6a26c70d689b37965\"></h5><h5>Generation III ('10–15)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/28fc8f87dccf4f4c46c2822771e3a0a8be8a2c41ed4dedbc1c073f0a06041f3e\"></h5><h5>Generation IV ('16–22)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/c9a2189fa072bd07884d443a1adbfc2023ab3570decbec450777ec7bde7aa9db\"></h5><h5>Prius V ('12–17)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/33419a22e57b3a8069595e219fa8b4eff0fbf303243ed26677786cfe21ea958b\"></h5><h5>Prius C ('12–19)<br><img class=\"min-w-[100px] min-h-[100px]\" src=\"https://fvdevhpbooirqodnxcyc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blobs/01a56c9a03b283c6eef9bd67e6c6d839a12e24892d34ec7d57d01d4977201a03\"></h5></div><switch data-switchtype=\"button\" class=\"font-bold flex flex-wrap\"><assignee class=\"\">priusGeneration</assignee><case data-id=\"c-fn3Xa\" class=\"\">Gen II</case><case data-id=\"c-H7fAj\" class=\"\">Gen III</case><case data-id=\"c-HwhAN\" class=\"\">Gen IV</case><case data-id=\"c-FqHBU\" class=\"\">Prius V</case><case data-id=\"c-XzRn6\" class=\"\">Prius C</case><case data-id=\"c-H7WQ7\" class=\"\">Something Else</case></switch>"},{"id":"start","position":{"x":-640.8530971158654,"y":-8374.947658429188},"type":"start"}],"darts":[{"from":"NP4rd","case":"c-8zCWc","to":"UkkxE","id":"ejfW9","type":"goto"},{"from":"NP4rd","case":"c-fMHg3","to":"UkkxE","id":"THm7c","type":"goto"},{"from":"fzdXq","case":"c-JjeYx","to":"UMpCn","id":"m3zQk","type":"goto"},{"from":"RRq7H","case":"default","to":"UMpCn","id":"YMiiL","type":"goto"},{"from":"HptdD","case":"default","to":"UMpCn","id":"eBp8W","type":"goto"},{"from":"qiKTB","case":"c-fn3Xa","to":"X4Etc","id":"dMQLX","type":"goto"},{"from":"qiKTB","case":"c-H7fAj","to":"X4Etc","id":"Kf4yx","type":"goto"},{"from":"qiKTB","case":"c-HwhAN","to":"X4Etc","id":"4pccx","type":"goto"},{"from":"X4Etc","case":"c-B6EHD","to":"fzdXq","id":"9BdNT","type":"goto"},{"from":"X4Etc","case":"c-EMe6W","to":"fzdXq","id":"zcJwk","type":"goto"},{"from":"X4Etc","case":"c-bd7mD","to":"fzdXq","id":"L3MTy","type":"goto"},{"from":"akbff","case":"default","to":"LTqDE","id":"D9QK8","type":"goto"},{"from":"akbff","case":"c-y9Cyy","to":"akbff","id":"3zPeE","type":"goto"},{"from":"nCCUM","case":"default","to":"mtjTN","id":"KM4dX","type":"goto"},{"from":"UMpCn","case":"c-3YPxX","to":"prUKA","id":"69y8Q","type":"goto"},{"from":"UMpCn","case":"c-bpgjB","to":"47cnH"